Notes on raw source material:

The `ufo-kb/raw/` directory contains transcripts and excerpts from third-party
sources (YouTube videos, books, articles, government documents). These are
included for research, citation, and reproducibility under fair-use principles.
The CC-BY-SA license above applies to the wiki summaries, synthesis pages,
constitution, skills, and tooling — original work — not to the raw source
material itself, which retains its original copyright. If you are a rights
holder and want a specific raw file removed, please open an issue.
